# Planning scripts require no credentials.
# Optional, installation-selected source for backend Barkpark connections.
# Origin only: no path, user credentials, query or fragment. Production requires HTTPS.
# GITGOOD_BARKPARK_ORIGIN=https://barkpark.example.invalid
# Optional installation-managed PEM trust bundle for a private source issuer. Normal TLS verification remains enabled.
# GITGOOD_BARKPARK_CA=/absolute/path/to/source-ca.pem
# Required when enabling production connections: base64 of 32 independently generated random bytes.
# Keep this installation key in a secret store and coordinated recovery materials; never commit it.
# GITGOOD_CONNECTION_KEY=
